(5249860, 763578, 100393, '<td valign="top">I know how hard it is to get these sorts of images to look good. If you have hollowed the apple out (which I think you have), I think some internal masking of the bright portion of the apple would''ve helped you to control the exposure a little more and get a more dramatic result.</td>', 'I know how hard it is to get these sorts of images to look good. If you have hollowed the apple out (which I think you have), I think some internal masking of the bright portion of the apple would''ve helped you to control the exposure a little more and get a more dramatic result.', '2009-02-11 04:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5249864, 763464, 60173, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty good fit!<br/> <br/>If in the future you''re wanting to keep the apple from going brown while you''re shooting, dip it in lemon juice. I don''t know why it works, but it does!</td>', 'That''s a pretty good fit! If in the future you''re wanting to keep the apple from going brown while you''re shooting, dip it in lemon juice. I don''t know why it works, but it does!', '2009-02-11 04:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
