(5252064, 764386, 88136, '<td valign="top">i didnt actually know it was an apple for like 3 minutes. i get that you are trying for a different and abstract approach on the challenge, but its not exactly appealing to me. perhaps its the focus, and the chair leg and half foot on the left hand side.</td>', 'i didnt actually know it was an apple for like 3 minutes. i get that you are trying for a different and abstract approach on the challenge, but its not exactly appealing to me. perhaps its the focus, and the chair leg and half foot on the left hand side.', '2009-02-11 21:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
