(5252069, 764101, 88136, '<td valign="top">i was going to enter a photo like this, but missed the rollover. yours would have kicked mines butt anyways:) i like how crisp the apple looks, and the flame is captured at just the right moment for it to appear dramatic</td>', 'i was going to enter a photo like this, but missed the rollover. yours would have kicked mines butt anyways:) i like how crisp the apple looks, and the flame is captured at just the right moment for it to appear dramatic', '2009-02-11 21:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252070, 763410, 88136, '<td valign="top">lol what fun</td>', 'lol what fun', '2009-02-11 21:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252072, 764526, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great execution of the set, especially that carving. Lighting is well done also. Post processing is letting it down a little, I''m afraid. It comes off as a bit on the dull side to me. I popped it into my editor to see for myself and some quick adjustments really made this one very good. I''d give it a 4 if I had only taken only a 3 second glance, but you did so well with the setup of this, that I have to give it a 6 to recognize the good job on the setup.</td>', 'Great execution of the set, especially that carving. Lighting is well done also. Post processing is letting it down a little, I''m afraid. It comes off as a bit on the dull side to me. I popped it into my editor to see for myself and some quick adjustments really made this one very good. I''d give it a 4 if I had only taken only a 3 second glance, but you did so well with the setup of this, that I have to give it a 6 to recognize the good job on the setup.', '2009-02-11 21:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252073, 764267, 88136, '<td valign="top">your title sounds like something that would actually happen on ebay or something. very nice photo, the reflection of the basket really appeals to me.</td>', 'your title sounds like something that would actually happen on ebay or something. very nice photo, the reflection of the basket really appeals to me.', '2009-02-11 21:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252075, 764579, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and creative. I''d like some details on your exposure and how you lit this.</td>', 'Nicely done and creative. I''d like some details on your exposure and how you lit this.', '2009-02-11 21:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252077, 764504, 88136, '<td valign="top">i like the composition and color, but this doesnt quite have the ''umph'' to grab me. not sure why. i like the perfect little refelctions in the waterdrops</td>', 'i like the composition and color, but this doesnt quite have the ''umph'' to grab me. not sure why. i like the perfect little refelctions in the waterdrops', '2009-02-11 21:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252081, 764016, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit over-something-or-other.  Not sure what it is but it seems almost blown out on detail in a few places.</td>', 'Seems a bit over-something-or-other.  Not sure what it is but it seems almost blown out on detail in a few places.', '2009-02-11 21:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
