(5252144, 764541, 83313, '<td valign="top">Apples practicing S&amp;M?!! I like the bokeh background, the apple itself seems a little soft.Focus appears to be on the pins in the upper right.</td>', 'Apples practicing S&M?!! I like the bokeh background, the apple itself seems a little soft.Focus appears to be on the pins in the upper right.', '2009-02-11 22:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252165, 763913, 83313, '<td valign="top">I said I was not going to DNMC any computer shots and I am true to my word. <br/> <br/>I AM a nitpicker, however. This is not an Apple computer, it is an IPod. And Apple has now taken the word "computer" out of their company name. So it is just an "Apple". Meets the challenge in my book. The description did NOT specify fruit. Oh, and nice shot.</td>', 'I said I was not going to DNMC any computer shots and I am true to my word.  I AM a nitpicker, however. This is not an Apple computer, it is an IPod. And Apple has now taken the word "computer" out of their company name. So it is just an "Apple". Meets the challenge in my book. The description did NOT specify fruit. Oh, and nice shot.', '2009-02-11 22:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252173, 764647, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but seems a bit grainy to me. The color looks slightly odd as well, I''m afraid. At first glance, I thought these were peaches.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but seems a bit grainy to me. The color looks slightly odd as well, I''m afraid. At first glance, I thought these were peaches.', '2009-02-11 22:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252174, 764247, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yuk. Good job.</td>', 'Yuk. Good job.', '2009-02-11 22:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252183, 764240, 94235, '<td valign="top">Just taking a bite has got to be easier!  Nice set up and clever take on the challege.</td>', 'Just taking a bite has got to be easier!  Nice set up and clever take on the challege.', '2009-02-11 22:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252184, 763589, 102024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea and well executed.  Just a few gripes... I can still see the divide between the two apples, and I do wish the lighting reflection wasn''t so harsh.  Aside from that I like it, the colors are nice and the background fits well.</td>', 'Wonderful idea and well executed.  Just a few gripes... I can still see the divide between the two apples, and I do wish the lighting reflection wasn''t so harsh.  Aside from that I like it, the colors are nice and the background fits well.', '2009-02-11 22:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252196, 764267, 94235, '<td valign="top">What a bargain....I''ll have half an ounce then, please! No,...on second thoughts how about just giving you a good score? Nice shot.</td>', 'What a bargain....I''ll have half an ounce then, please! No,...on second thoughts how about just giving you a good score? Nice shot.', '2009-02-11 22:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
