(5252205, 764342, 94235, '<td valign="top">The first apple challenge winner''s entry looked more effective although this is still a good capture with great clarity. Well done.</td>', 'The first apple challenge winner''s entry looked more effective although this is still a good capture with great clarity. Well done.', '2009-02-11 22:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
