(5252354, 764487, 79955, '<td valign="top">Try experimenting with different lighting methods. I would recommend both frontal lighting (as you have done here) and bounced top lighting to reduce the shadows.</td>', 'Try experimenting with different lighting methods. I would recommend both frontal lighting (as you have done here) and bounced top lighting to reduce the shadows.', '2009-02-11 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
