(5253465, 763133, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has more potential than is being illustrated here.  First thing is the background...the tan/brown in the upper left, the shadow upper right, the piece of something edge left - all take away from the subject IMO.  Also, the white cord - this shot could have been done without that, yes?  A circular polarizer (or repositioning the monitor angle) could have knocked down the reflection on the monitor screen.<br/> <br/>I do like the blue tones in this - if the entire photo was blue/black/white I think it would have been stronger.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck!</td>', 'This has more potential than is being illustrated here.  First thing is the background...the tan/brown in the upper left, the shadow upper right, the piece of something edge left - all take away from the subject IMO.  Also, the white cord - this shot could have been done without that, yes?  A circular polarizer (or repositioning the monitor angle) could have knocked down the reflection on the monitor screen. I do like the blue tones in this - if the entire photo was blue/black/white I think it would have been stronger.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck!', '2009-02-12 14:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
