(5254239, 764120, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, and nice alignment. It would be nice if the lighting in the iphone photo is same as and outside. Still one of my high score. Good Luck.</td>', 'Excellent idea, and nice alignment. It would be nice if the lighting in the iphone photo is same as and outside. Still one of my high score. Good Luck.', '2009-02-12 23:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
