(5254597, 764399, 46885, '<td valign="top">I can''t see any apples at all. Suspect it may be the face? The rest of the photo leaves me unmoved, lighting is boring and composition is out of whack. Focus is on most of the time but on the bucket, which, combined with the blown out highlight, clashes with my eye. Now, before you start getting very offended - there''s a discussion raging on about the merits of leaving low-marked images un-commented. Quite a lot of people are of opinion that low marks must be accompanied by a comment. I am of a different opinion, but decide to test the idea just in case. Hope this helped.</td>', 'I can''t see any apples at all. Suspect it may be the face? The rest of the photo leaves me unmoved, lighting is boring and composition is out of whack. Focus is on most of the time but on the bucket, which, combined with the blown out highlight, clashes with my eye. Now, before you start getting very offended - there''s a discussion raging on about the merits of leaving low-marked images un-commented. Quite a lot of people are of opinion that low marks must be accompanied by a comment. I am of a different opinion, but decide to test the idea just in case. Hope this helped.', '2009-02-13 07:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
