(5255453, 763075, 30454, '<td valign="top">Lighting is little harsh, creating dark shadows.</td>', 'Lighting is little harsh, creating dark shadows.', '2009-02-13 20:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255454, 763778, 30454, '<td valign="top">Good lighting here. But photo doesn''t jump at you. May be colored BG would have worked little better?</td>', 'Good lighting here. But photo doesn''t jump at you. May be colored BG would have worked little better?', '2009-02-13 20:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255457, 764399, 30454, '<td valign="top">Lighting is little flat. Photo is too busy with one too many elements.</td>', 'Lighting is little flat. Photo is too busy with one too many elements.', '2009-02-13 20:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255463, 764487, 30454, '<td valign="top">Subjects should be little far from the BG. They are almost too close that they are touching the BG. Ligting is little flat.</td>', 'Subjects should be little far from the BG. They are almost too close that they are touching the BG. Ligting is little flat.', '2009-02-13 20:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255467, 763653, 30454, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting. Nice title. Good Luck.</td>', 'Very good lighting. Nice title. Good Luck.', '2009-02-13 20:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255675, 762975, 102574, '<td valign="top">Simple and efficient</td>', 'Simple and efficient', '2009-02-13 23:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255676, 763589, 102574, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.</td>', 'Cool idea.', '2009-02-13 23:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255728, 762784, 88580, '<td valign="top">Nice and warm and cozy.  I can actually smell this photo.</td>', 'Nice and warm and cozy.  I can actually smell this photo.', '2009-02-14 00:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255733, 764087, 88580, '<td valign="top">With the wide-eyed, half-crazed look, her enthusiasm for apples seems to border on the psychotic.  Very interesting image.</td>', 'With the wide-eyed, half-crazed look, her enthusiasm for apples seems to border on the psychotic.  Very interesting image.', '2009-02-14 00:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255737, 764166, 88580, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of a turtle laying eggs.  Or maybe those are apple turds?  Either way it''s a good, original idea.</td>', 'Reminiscent of a turtle laying eggs.  Or maybe those are apple turds?  Either way it''s a good, original idea.', '2009-02-14 00:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255738, 764579, 88580, '<td valign="top">Clever optical illusion.</td>', 'Clever optical illusion.', '2009-02-14 00:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255741, 764199, 88580, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the red apple as a backdrop.</td>', 'Nice use of the red apple as a backdrop.', '2009-02-14 00:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255743, 763894, 88580, '<td valign="top">There is absolutely, positively no reason whatsoever for a shoehorn to be stuck into the side of an apple.  It simply makes one say, "what the..."  (However, the effect would be even stronger to those unfamiliar with this technique.)  I still love it.  I think the highlights really hurt it, though.  They pull your eye to them and subsequently blind you.</td>', 'There is absolutely, positively no reason whatsoever for a shoehorn to be stuck into the side of an apple.  It simply makes one say, "what the..."  (However, the effect would be even stronger to those unfamiliar with this technique.)  I still love it.  I think the highlights really hurt it, though.  They pull your eye to them and subsequently blind you.', '2009-02-14 00:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255744, 762729, 88580, '<td valign="top">Covering all the bases, I see.</td>', 'Covering all the bases, I see.', '2009-02-14 00:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255746, 762778, 88580, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  I feel like I''m part of the crowd, looking over his shoulder.</td>', 'Great angle.  I feel like I''m part of the crowd, looking over his shoulder.', '2009-02-14 00:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255770, 764149, 67363, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait but it is an "apple" challenge and don''t think the apple is the main subject of the photo.</td>', 'Lovely portrait but it is an "apple" challenge and don''t think the apple is the main subject of the photo.', '2009-02-14 01:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255803, 763956, 15511, '<td valign="top">Excellent! But NYC is only figuratively an apple...</td>', 'Excellent! But NYC is only figuratively an apple...', '2009-02-14 02:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255804, 764175, 15511, '<td valign="top">Uh, applecrab...</td>', 'Uh, applecrab...', '2009-02-14 02:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255857, 764600, 97166, '<td valign="top">A little more control of your environment (lighting, surface area, camera level, etc) is generally required for a still/studio shot such as this to really work on this website, as well as most anywhere.  The idea is clever, but not entirely well executed.  <br/> <br/>Things I notice are the harsh lighting on the apple tops, the "unclean" surface, and the tilt in the edge in the background.  For me, it leaves the photo feeling unfinished and hurried, and doesn''t make me want to linger on it.</td>', 'A little more control of your environment (lighting, surface area, camera level, etc) is generally required for a still/studio shot such as this to really work on this website, as well as most anywhere.  The idea is clever, but not entirely well executed.   Things I notice are the harsh lighting on the apple tops, the "unclean" surface, and the tilt in the edge in the background.  For me, it leaves the photo feeling unfinished and hurried, and doesn''t make me want to linger on it.', '2009-02-14 07:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255858, 764355, 97166, '<td valign="top">I want to laugh and call child services all in one. hehe. (Yes, I know the arrow wasn''t really shot at her. Or, at least, I''ve convinced myself of that)</td>', 'I want to laugh and call child services all in one. hehe. (Yes, I know the arrow wasn''t really shot at her. Or, at least, I''ve convinced myself of that)', '2009-02-14 07:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255859, 764162, 97166, '<td valign="top">Ah, the old "painting with light".  Nothing really new here though, so a 6.</td>', 'Ah, the old "painting with light".  Nothing really new here though, so a 6.', '2009-02-14 07:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255860, 763087, 97166, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I don''t like the execution. Focus is off, and interest just isn''t really there.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I don''t like the execution. Focus is off, and interest just isn''t really there.', '2009-02-14 07:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255861, 764392, 97166, '<td valign="top">FrankenApple</td>', 'FrankenApple', '2009-02-14 07:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255862, 764104, 97166, '<td valign="top">The highlights aren''t my favorite.</td>', 'The highlights aren''t my favorite.', '2009-02-14 07:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255863, 763666, 97166, '<td valign="top">You know, with a little more clever editing, you could have really been on to something here.  There''s a dynamic energy screaming to be let out, but the flatness of the lighting and general blah of the colors locks it away.</td>', 'You know, with a little more clever editing, you could have really been on to something here.  There''s a dynamic energy screaming to be let out, but the flatness of the lighting and general blah of the colors locks it away.', '2009-02-14 07:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255864, 763401, 97166, '<td valign="top">Why must we always fall back to water?</td>', 'Why must we always fall back to water?', '2009-02-14 07:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255865, 764415, 97166, '<td valign="top">Very courageous.  I''ll bump this for creativity, but as a stand-alone portrait, I think it misses the mark a little bit.</td>', 'Very courageous.  I''ll bump this for creativity, but as a stand-alone portrait, I think it misses the mark a little bit.', '2009-02-14 07:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255866, 764507, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''m beginning to think we should just rename this website to Liquid Photography Challenge.</td>', 'I''m beginning to think we should just rename this website to Liquid Photography Challenge.', '2009-02-14 07:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255867, 764434, 97166, '<td valign="top">Nicely creative.</td>', 'Nicely creative.', '2009-02-14 07:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255871, 763653, 97166, '<td valign="top">Made me giggle.</td>', 'Made me giggle.', '2009-02-14 07:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255874, 764577, 97166, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I was actually considering carving an Apple IIe out of an actual apple, but then realized what kind of work that would entail, and thought better of it.  I really love the color contrast you have going on here, with the organic colorization in the apple (flesh and blood), with the almost industrial feel of the surface/background.  Fantastic.</td>', 'Very nice!  I was actually considering carving an Apple IIe out of an actual apple, but then realized what kind of work that would entail, and thought better of it.  I really love the color contrast you have going on here, with the organic colorization in the apple (flesh and blood), with the almost industrial feel of the surface/background.  Fantastic.', '2009-02-14 07:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255881, 764175, 97166, '<td valign="top"><i>snicker</i></td>', 'snicker', '2009-02-14 07:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
