(5256004, 764645, 33361, '<td valign="top">honestly - I don''t think this was executed very well. I think the apple should be more in focus and less on the arrow (I''m assuming it''s an arrow by the title?) which doesn''t have an arrow tip.</td>', 'honestly - I don''t think this was executed very well. I think the apple should be more in focus and less on the arrow (I''m assuming it''s an arrow by the title?) which doesn''t have an arrow tip.', '2009-02-14 10:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
