(5259821, 764621, 93283, '<td valign="top">Apples are alittle dark but I think that helps bring out the color in the tulips and it may have been intentional :) Its a very good still life. The lighting on the tulips is amazing. 7</td>', 'Apples are alittle dark but I think that helps bring out the color in the tulips and it may have been intentional :) Its a very good still life. The lighting on the tulips is amazing. 7', '2009-02-16 23:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
