(5260385, 763745, 100106, '<td valign="top">Like how you decided to go with a different color apple. Better than the norm. Also like the angle. Good lighting and DOF.</td>', 'Like how you decided to go with a different color apple. Better than the norm. Also like the angle. Good lighting and DOF.', '2009-02-17 11:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260387, 762877, 100106, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of shadows where some may not. I enjoy how only the tops are in the light. It makes me draw the rest of the lines on my own. Nice color as well.</td>', 'I''m a big fan of shadows where some may not. I enjoy how only the tops are in the light. It makes me draw the rest of the lines on my own. Nice color as well.', '2009-02-17 11:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260394, 763461, 100106, '<td valign="top">Good timing on the cpature. Also like the contrast between the white/red. Nice choice there. Good focus and depth as well.</td>', 'Good timing on the cpature. Also like the contrast between the white/red. Nice choice there. Good focus and depth as well.', '2009-02-17 11:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260398, 764390, 100106, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and title. Wouldn''t have needed it though because of the stripe. Only reason I''m pointing that out is alot of the times, the title is the only thing that gives the picture its meaning. Also like how the light is a spotlight type. Adds to the theme really well.</td>', 'Clever idea and title. Wouldn''t have needed it though because of the stripe. Only reason I''m pointing that out is alot of the times, the title is the only thing that gives the picture its meaning. Also like how the light is a spotlight type. Adds to the theme really well.', '2009-02-17 11:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260400, 764392, 100106, '<td valign="top">Creative idea here. The staples make the shot IMO. Also, nice job the joining the two skins. My only suggestion or thought would be a different color for the background. It might have helped the apple pop more. Just a thought. Overall, nicely done.</td>', 'Creative idea here. The staples make the shot IMO. Also, nice job the joining the two skins. My only suggestion or thought would be a different color for the background. It might have helped the apple pop more. Just a thought. Overall, nicely done.', '2009-02-17 11:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
