(5260622, 763589, 98141, '<td valign="top">Strange! and interesting. I like the background colors morphing to reflect the colors of the apple. Lighting/shine on the apple is a little hot, but very clever idea for a pic. I''d like to read about how you did your background.</td>', 'Strange! and interesting. I like the background colors morphing to reflect the colors of the apple. Lighting/shine on the apple is a little hot, but very clever idea for a pic. I''d like to read about how you did your background.', '2009-02-17 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
