(5261115, 764639, 93283, '<td valign="top">I think this is like the 4th B&amp;W I''ve come across in this challenge and I find it refreshing because the emphasis in most of the photos, including my own, in this challenge was color. I think it is more difficult to construct a shot when you take color out of the equation. Having said that, the lighting is good, the apple and water drops are sharp, and the grapes are a nice touch. Well done!</td>', 'I think this is like the 4th B&W I''ve come across in this challenge and I find it refreshing because the emphasis in most of the photos, including my own, in this challenge was color. I think it is more difficult to construct a shot when you take color out of the equation. Having said that, the lighting is good, the apple and water drops are sharp, and the grapes are a nice touch. Well done!', '2009-02-17 18:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
