(5261360, 763426, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, I give you a 10 just because I like Magritte too, and your picture is a very fine tribute.  And because I also wear a hat. <br/> <br/>I think this will score very high, but in spite of that I do like it very much.  <br/> <br/>So thanks for providing the most (almost the only) entertaining entry, for which I also award DPC''s most dubious distinction; the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Well, I give you a 10 just because I like Magritte too, and your picture is a very fine tribute.  And because I also wear a hat.  I think this will score very high, but in spite of that I do like it very much.   So thanks for providing the most (almost the only) entertaining entry, for which I also award DPC''s most dubious distinction; the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-02-17 20:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
