(5261399, 764545, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great Idea!  I did something very similar (Mine is the one with the thin white border and the gray background, with a red apple with drips on it... it looks just like this... I had some trouble with the shot, IMO it looks best if you focus on the part of the apple cosest to the camera, and then to get some nice large drips, I covered the apple with Vaseline... Great shot though!</td>', 'Great Idea!  I did something very similar (Mine is the one with the thin white border and the gray background, with a red apple with drips on it... it looks just like this... I had some trouble with the shot, IMO it looks best if you focus on the part of the apple cosest to the camera, and then to get some nice large drips, I covered the apple with Vaseline... Great shot though!', '2009-02-17 20:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
