(5261403, 763768, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great Idea, But IMO it would probably score Much higher if the apple was more visible... most voters (probably like 80%) only look at the pictures for a fraction of a second then place their vote... I bet that a large number of voters didn''t even see the apple... I really like the idea, i''m giving you a 9/10.  Great Job!</td>', 'Great Idea, But IMO it would probably score Much higher if the apple was more visible... most voters (probably like 80%) only look at the pictures for a fraction of a second then place their vote... I bet that a large number of voters didn''t even see the apple... I really like the idea, i''m giving you a 9/10.  Great Job!', '2009-02-17 20:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
