(5261408, 764526, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great idea!!!  IMO would score much higher if the background/floor was pure white (could be done with some background lights...  You can see my entry for the Personification challenge, I took a pic of some peanuts... I had trouble getting the ground/background pure white, so I used a medium softbox from above to flood the peanuts and background/floor with light so that the background and floor turn pure white, i''m still giving you a 7/10 because it''s a great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!!!  IMO would score much higher if the background/floor was pure white (could be done with some background lights...  You can see my entry for the Personification challenge, I took a pic of some peanuts... I had trouble getting the ground/background pure white, so I used a medium softbox from above to flood the peanuts and background/floor with light so that the background and floor turn pure white, i''m still giving you a 7/10 because it''s a great idea!', '2009-02-17 20:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
