(5262267, 764391, 96574, '<td valign="top">thanks Limbri and everyone that took the time to comment. i had a feeling it wouldnt do too well but i just laugh everytime i think of the title and how it goes along with the picture, and how the picture came out too of course.<br/> <br/>here''s an out take of my alternative entry. wouldve done better but probably not much higher than mid 5''s since it''s a bit soft.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=764672" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96574/120/764672.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96574/120/764672.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96574/120/764672.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-18 03:45:39.</i></td>', 'thanks Limbri and everyone that took the time to comment. i had a feeling it wouldnt do too well but i just laugh everytime i think of the title and how it goes along with the picture, and how the picture came out too of course. here''s an out take of my alternative entry. wouldve done better but probably not much higher than mid 5''s since it''s a bit soft.', '2009-02-18 03:43:55.000000', '2009-02-18 03:45:39.000000', 0),
(5262271, 763426, 60383, '<td valign="top">This pic scored way too high in my opinion. The mission was to photograph an apple. This is a photo of a man... that happens to have an apple. If I''m somebodies boss and send that person out with the orders "bring me a photo of an apple" and this is what he brings back... I fire that guy.<br/> <br/>But by itself it''s a nice photo. Just not in this context.</td>', 'This pic scored way too high in my opinion. The mission was to photograph an apple. This is a photo of a man... that happens to have an apple. If I''m somebodies boss and send that person out with the orders "bring me a photo of an apple" and this is what he brings back... I fire that guy. But by itself it''s a nice photo. Just not in this context.', '2009-02-18 03:47:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262281, 764240, 49109, '<td valign="top">The idea was brillant, yet I gave you a 6. As already said, lighting could be enhanced, too many distracting shadows here. the OOF finger at bottom right is also an issue. Lastly, the image is very busy and the close crop enhances this impression. I fi had to redo this image, I''d leave away the apples in background, the left cable, the illustration on the "manual and put the notebook in a straight, centered position. A black backgound and soft side lighting should do the rest.<br/></td>', 'The idea was brillant, yet I gave you a 6. As already said, lighting could be enhanced, too many distracting shadows here. the OOF finger at bottom right is also an issue. Lastly, the image is very busy and the close crop enhances this impression. I fi had to redo this image, I''d leave away the apples in background, the left cable, the illustration on the "manual and put the notebook in a straight, centered position. A black backgound and soft side lighting should do the rest.', '2009-02-18 03:54:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262384, 763538, 20608, '<td valign="top">15th no too shabby mate, way better than mine</td>', '15th no too shabby mate, way better than mine', '2009-02-18 06:16:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262397, 763641, 79955, '<td valign="top">Kok Weng, I actually voted a 5 on this. 1st off the composition is ok , and I do like the concept. I am however not comfortable with the colors &amp; hue you selected in your post processing, because of this I did not score it higher. I would have liked a healthier looking version (maybe a more tanned skin tone with a nice juicy red saturated apple.<br/> <br/>I do applaud your concept !! bravo.</td>', 'Kok Weng, I actually voted a 5 on this. 1st off the composition is ok , and I do like the concept. I am however not comfortable with the colors & hue you selected in your post processing, because of this I did not score it higher. I would have liked a healthier looking version (maybe a more tanned skin tone with a nice juicy red saturated apple. I do applaud your concept !! bravo.', '2009-02-18 06:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262423, 763426, 32767, '<td valign="top">"This pic scored way too high in my opinion. The mission was to photograph an apple. This is a photo of a man... that happens to have an apple. If I''m somebodies boss and send that person out with the orders "bring me a photo of an apple" and this is what he brings back... I fire that guy."<br/> <br/>This dude needs to lighten up. Don''t ya think?<br/> <br/>I like it. The apple shares the stage with equal gusto to the person, the hat and even the ponytail.<br/> <br/>Cheers and congrats on your Thunmb.<br/></td>', '"This pic scored way too high in my opinion. The mission was to photograph an apple. This is a photo of a man... that happens to have an apple. If I''m somebodies boss and send that person out with the orders "bring me a photo of an apple" and this is what he brings back... I fire that guy." This dude needs to lighten up. Don''t ya think? I like it. The apple shares the stage with equal gusto to the person, the hat and even the ponytail. Cheers and congrats on your Thunmb.', '2009-02-18 07:01:55.000000', NULL, 0),
