(5262468, 763426, 88580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Limbri:</b></div><hr/><i>The mission was to photograph an apple. This is a photo of a man... that happens to have an apple. If I''m somebodies boss and send that person out with the orders "bring me a photo of an apple" and this is what he brings back... I fire that guy.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The "mission" was to "<u><i><b>Creatively</b></i></u> photograph an apple any way you see fit."  If you set an apple on the table and brought me a picture of it, I would fire you.  Besides this is not an assignment or a job...and you''re not my boss.</td>', 'Originally posted by Limbri:The mission was to photograph an apple. This is a photo of a man... that happens to have an apple. If I''m somebodies boss and send that person out with the orders "bring me a photo of an apple" and this is what he brings back... I fire that guy.  The "mission" was to "Creatively photograph an apple any way you see fit."  If you set an apple on the table and brought me a picture of it, I would fire you.  Besides this is not an assignment or a job...and you''re not my boss.', '2009-02-18 07:45:29.000000', NULL, 0),
