(5262479, 763426, 88580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pawdrix:</b></div><hr/><i>This dude needs to lighten up. Don''t ya think?</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, no doubt.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pawdrix:</b></div><hr/><i>I like it. The apple shares the stage with equal gusto to the person, the hat and even the ponytail.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pawdrix:</b></div><hr/><i>Cheers and congrats on your Thunmb. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>And thanks.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-18 10:35:43.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by pawdrix:This dude needs to lighten up. Don''t ya think?  Yeah, no doubt. Originally posted by pawdrix:I like it. The apple shares the stage with equal gusto to the person, the hat and even the ponytail.  Thanks. Originally posted by pawdrix:Cheers and congrats on your Thunmb.   And thanks.', '2009-02-18 07:48:12.000000', '2009-02-18 10:35:43.000000', 0),
