(5262530, 764237, 76198, '<td valign="top">What I did was to hollow out the apple and place it over a strobe - all the light you see is coming from in the apple. If I could figure out how to do it and have someone holding the apple I think it would be more obvious that it''s glowing...</td>', 'What I did was to hollow out the apple and place it over a strobe - all the light you see is coming from in the apple. If I could figure out how to do it and have someone holding the apple I think it would be more obvious that it''s glowing...', '2009-02-18 08:23:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262541, 763723, 81530, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a hidden gem. A 7 from me.</td>', 'I think it''s a hidden gem. A 7 from me.', '2009-02-18 08:31:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262584, 763569, 87040, '<td valign="top">This may be an "overdone" shot, but I REALLY appreciate that you took the time to comment on what it took to make it work.  I''m a very low end glorified amateur. Knowing what goes into it helps me appreciate it. I cruise this site looking for ideas on what makes a composition "work" and to see how the high end amateurs and real professionals treat subject matter.  What they HAVE to get right in the shot, and what they can take care of in editing.  Thanks again!</td>', 'This may be an "overdone" shot, but I REALLY appreciate that you took the time to comment on what it took to make it work.  I''m a very low end glorified amateur. Knowing what goes into it helps me appreciate it. I cruise this site looking for ideas on what makes a composition "work" and to see how the high end amateurs and real professionals treat subject matter.  What they HAVE to get right in the shot, and what they can take care of in editing.  Thanks again!', '2009-02-18 08:52:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262593, 764479, 58457, '<td valign="top">nice shot, from your 71st place neighbor!</td>', 'nice shot, from your 71st place neighbor!', '2009-02-18 08:55:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262595, 763461, 102574, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and the votes. I knew it was not a groundbreaking idea but I wanted to make a splash-shot. I had fun doing it. There was milk all over the place after the session :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-18 15:54:24.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and the votes. I knew it was not a groundbreaking idea but I wanted to make a splash-shot. I had fun doing it. There was milk all over the place after the session :-)', '2009-02-18 08:55:57.000000', '2009-02-18 15:54:24.000000', 0),
(5262601, 763589, 58457, '<td valign="top">Congrats from your 71st place neighbor.  <br/> <br/>this is a clever little shot.  I think had you been able to reduce those reflections, you would''ve scored higher.</td>', 'Congrats from your 71st place neighbor.   this is a clever little shot.  I think had you been able to reduce those reflections, you would''ve scored higher.', '2009-02-18 08:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262615, 764579, 77507, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i>Congrats on the HM, I wish there was a ribbon for 4th place. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hah... me too!   :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-18 09:05:30.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by IreneM:Congrats on the HM, I wish there was a ribbon for 4th place.   hah... me too!   :-)', '2009-02-18 09:05:11.000000', '2009-02-18 09:05:30.000000', 0),
(5262621, 764135, 52549, '<td valign="top">Can''t see the red speck but love the image! Congrats on your red ribbon.</td>', 'Can''t see the red speck but love the image! Congrats on your red ribbon.', '2009-02-18 09:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262622, 762784, 61222, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon this was one of my favorites. :)</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon this was one of my favorites. :)', '2009-02-18 09:06:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262627, 762784, 52549, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful and a very worthy ribbon winner. Congrats, Agnes.</td>', 'Really beautiful and a very worthy ribbon winner. Congrats, Agnes.', '2009-02-18 09:08:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262661, 762784, 103958, '<td valign="top">awesome shot. I love the mood and textures.</td>', 'awesome shot. I love the mood and textures.', '2009-02-18 09:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262665, 764645, 30049, '<td valign="top">See?!  I told you some fletching would help, even if it was OOF it would help sell the story (for those not convinced it was an arrow).  I really liked your approach on this - the OOF bg works great in this scenario.<br/> <br/>Very creative!</td>', 'See?!  I told you some fletching would help, even if it was OOF it would help sell the story (for those not convinced it was an arrow).  I really liked your approach on this - the OOF bg works great in this scenario. Very creative!', '2009-02-18 09:35:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262674, 763800, 66494, '<td valign="top">Aimee,<br/>I adore your pinned shots. And this is magnificent. Darlene is right on ... you are the QUEEN of pins!! And you pinned a 10 from me.</td>', 'Aimee,I adore your pinned shots. And this is magnificent. Darlene is right on ... you are the QUEEN of pins!! And you pinned a 10 from me.', '2009-02-18 09:42:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262675, 763723, 30049, '<td valign="top">I was the only one to give this a 10?!  I found this photo to be quite refreshing in a field of water drops/splashes and computers.  The composition is spot on.  Great eye to see this with the one apple with leaves on it.  With any lens other than a lensbaby I don''t think this would have worked as well (too much would have been in focus - even wide open).<br/> <br/>It just feels so REAL.  Very nice - I''m sorry to see it placed so far down the line.</td>', 'I was the only one to give this a 10?!  I found this photo to be quite refreshing in a field of water drops/splashes and computers.  The composition is spot on.  Great eye to see this with the one apple with leaves on it.  With any lens other than a lensbaby I don''t think this would have worked as well (too much would have been in focus - even wide open). It just feels so REAL.  Very nice - I''m sorry to see it placed so far down the line.', '2009-02-18 09:42:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262697, 764577, 86447, '<td valign="top">Very creative apple shot.</td>', 'Very creative apple shot.', '2009-02-18 10:02:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262715, 764577, 65083, '<td valign="top">I did not vote in this challenge, if I had this would have gotten high marks from me just for the fact that it is carved I have no talent like this.</td>', 'I did not vote in this challenge, if I had this would have gotten high marks from me just for the fact that it is carved I have no talent like this.', '2009-02-18 10:19:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262717, 764379, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice job and good finish.</td>', 'Nice job and good finish.', '2009-02-18 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262723, 763723, 65083, '<td valign="top">Deb had I voted in this challenge I would have scored this at least a six.  I like the fact that it was not set up and you went out and found this.</td>', 'Deb had I voted in this challenge I would have scored this at least a six.  I like the fact that it was not set up and you went out and found this.', '2009-02-18 10:22:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262724, 764379, 73235, '<td valign="top">Congrats to your finish. well done</td>', 'Congrats to your finish. well done', '2009-02-18 10:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262731, 763458, 65083, '<td valign="top">If I had voted in this challenge this would have scored high with me because of the abstractness.</td>', 'If I had voted in this challenge this would have scored high with me because of the abstractness.', '2009-02-18 10:28:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262737, 764379, 65083, '<td valign="top">what a great shot congrats on your finish.</td>', 'what a great shot congrats on your finish.', '2009-02-18 10:30:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262747, 763576, 70852, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for the encouraging and supportive comments. I''m surprised the score was so poor. I knew it was risky, but I thought I''d submit something different. I still like it. :)</td>', 'Thank you very much for the encouraging and supportive comments. I''m surprised the score was so poor. I knew it was risky, but I thought I''d submit something different. I still like it. :)', '2009-02-18 10:35:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262790, 764236, 101838, '<td valign="top">Post ...<br/>Looking at the past Apple challenge I realized that there is going to be a lot of colorful apples with water, so I tried to make something different, which lead me to B&amp;W shot. <br/>Well, I guess I should have stayed in color/water area.</td>', 'Post ...Looking at the past Apple challenge I realized that there is going to be a lot of colorful apples with water, so I tried to make something different, which lead me to B&W shot. Well, I guess I should have stayed in color/water area.', '2009-02-18 11:03:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262793, 764342, 100064, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this but after my lemon in the Brown Ribbon Challenge and that disaster I said forget it! hahaha.  Basic editing wasnt good for me to do this but you did a great job!<br/> <br/>Thank you for your comment on mine and your appreciation for my work!</td>', 'I thought about doing this but after my lemon in the Brown Ribbon Challenge and that disaster I said forget it! hahaha.  Basic editing wasnt good for me to do this but you did a great job! Thank you for your comment on mine and your appreciation for my work!', '2009-02-18 11:03:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262808, 764103, 45259, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments!<br/> <br/>Apples are actually a favorite thing my mine to doodle so I could not pass up an opportunity to try to photograph them.<br/> <br/>Turns out to be one of the best things I have submitted<br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'Thank you for all your comments! Apples are actually a favorite thing my mine to doodle so I could not pass up an opportunity to try to photograph them. Turns out to be one of the best things I have submitted Thanks again!', '2009-02-18 11:09:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262811, 764577, 33361, '<td valign="top">I think we should give you your own posthumous award for this one!</td>', 'I think we should give you your own posthumous award for this one!', '2009-02-18 11:10:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5262859, 764379, 67697, '<td valign="top">beautiful idea to capture this in the snow.  love that the snow was falling too.  congrats on a great finish!</td>', 'beautiful idea to capture this in the snow.  love that the snow was falling too.  congrats on a great finish!', '2009-02-18 11:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
