(5263156, 764367, 37845, '<td valign="top">I dont know what it is about your photos... but you always have this outstanding clarity on them. I envy your consistency :)</td>', 'I dont know what it is about your photos... but you always have this outstanding clarity on them. I envy your consistency :)', '2009-02-18 13:39:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263162, 764367, 67152, '<td valign="top">Apples and other sure shiny fruit can be exceedingly difficult to photograph well - and this is an outstanding example of perfect use of lighting angles.  Good work Irene.</td>', 'Apples and other sure shiny fruit can be exceedingly difficult to photograph well - and this is an outstanding example of perfect use of lighting angles.  Good work Irene.', '2009-02-18 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263190, 764579, 102362, '<td valign="top">very creative :]</td>', 'very creative :]', '2009-02-18 14:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263223, 764577, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That takes serious talent!  The carving part.  Not the cookie sheet outside part.  THAT part I''ve done before but without the carved apple.  Really loses something in translation at that point.  But did you keep the apple and let it dry and get withered and do another shot of the visage?</td>', 'Wow.  That takes serious talent!  The carving part.  Not the cookie sheet outside part.  THAT part I''ve done before but without the carved apple.  Really loses something in translation at that point.  But did you keep the apple and let it dry and get withered and do another shot of the visage?', '2009-02-18 14:17:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263229, 763458, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sliced in just the right place, and good job blowing out the background - makes this rather cheerful!</td>', 'Sliced in just the right place, and good job blowing out the background - makes this rather cheerful!', '2009-02-18 14:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263232, 764379, 30982, '<td valign="top">You just keep on non-sucking... you''re doing a great job of it!</td>', 'You just keep on non-sucking... you''re doing a great job of it!', '2009-02-18 14:19:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263275, 763895, 102481, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m sorry, it''s probably something familiar to others, but I can''t figure out what the contraption is in the foreground... I''d really like to know... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s a bow and arrow!</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: I''m sorry, it''s probably something familiar to others, but I can''t figure out what the contraption is in the foreground... I''d really like to know...   It''s a bow and arrow!', '2009-02-18 14:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263293, 764135, 81530, '<td valign="top">Next time have a blue speck instead, hopefully it will match up with the ribbon. Congrats.</td>', 'Next time have a blue speck instead, hopefully it will match up with the ribbon. Congrats.', '2009-02-18 14:37:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263294, 762784, 81530, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures. Congrats.</td>', 'Interesting textures. Congrats.', '2009-02-18 14:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263305, 763723, 70514, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this challenge, but this really stands out to me.  The colors are pretty and not hitting me over the head vibrant, which I like.  And that sweet spot couldn''t be used better here.  Very pretty and has a quality to it that reminds me of childhood summers.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this challenge, but this really stands out to me.  The colors are pretty and not hitting me over the head vibrant, which I like.  And that sweet spot couldn''t be used better here.  Very pretty and has a quality to it that reminds me of childhood summers.', '2009-02-18 14:41:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263502, 762784, 30807, '<td valign="top">Aw, shucks! - I could have eaten this apple - and now you tell me it''s not real!!<br/>Thats so impressive I am embarrassed! - a very top result - I think it should have got further - it could be used in an apple advert!<br/> <br/>Congrats!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Aw, shucks! - I could have eaten this apple - and now you tell me it''s not real!!Thats so impressive I am embarrassed! - a very top result - I think it should have got further - it could be used in an apple advert! Congrats! ', '2009-02-18 15:49:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263573, 762784, 100064, '<td valign="top">I did buy over 10 lbs of apples first tho to do other pictures like the ones of my out takes. hahaha. So I didnt get away without spending some money but its a good thing we like apples around here. Just so happened the coloring of the fake apple worked better. :=)<br/> <br/>Thanks every body!!</td>', 'I did buy over 10 lbs of apples first tho to do other pictures like the ones of my out takes. hahaha. So I didnt get away without spending some money but its a good thing we like apples around here. Just so happened the coloring of the fake apple worked better. :=) Thanks every body!!', '2009-02-18 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263596, 764577, 30861, '<td valign="top">Helluva Image dude.<br/> <br/>"An apple serves as well as any skull<br/>to be the book in which to read a round,<br/>and is as excellent, in that it is composed<br/>of what, like skulls, comes rotting back to ground.<br/> <br/>But it excels in this, that as the fruit<br/>of love, it is a book too mad to read<br/>before one merely reads to pass the time..."<br/> <br/> Wallace Stevens<br/> <br/><i>From memory, so I may not have it exactly right)</i> <br/> <br/>R.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-18 16:27:59.</i></td>', 'Helluva Image dude. "An apple serves as well as any skullto be the book in which to read a round,and is as excellent, in that it is composedof what, like skulls, comes rotting back to ground. But it excels in this, that as the fruitof love, it is a book too mad to readbefore one merely reads to pass the time..."  Wallace Stevens From memory, so I may not have it exactly right)  R.', '2009-02-18 16:27:12.000000', '2009-02-18 16:27:59.000000', 0),
