(5657569, 764046, 99256, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  Nice sharp focus.  I really like the water drops.  It does seem a little grainy, probably from the high ISO.  Also just a personal preference, I don''t really like the dark apple in the back.  I wonder if it would have popped more if you switched the dark and lighter red apples or used another brighter colored one.  Good shot either way.</td>', 'I like this one.  Nice sharp focus.  I really like the water drops.  It does seem a little grainy, probably from the high ISO.  Also just a personal preference, I don''t really like the dark apple in the back.  I wonder if it would have popped more if you switched the dark and lighter red apples or used another brighter colored one.  Good shot either way.', '2009-09-22 16:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
